)3 = 1 (x + 1)2 - 2 (x + 1)3."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.90673,"w":0.58894,"h":0.02882,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"In some problems, assigning small values to x, such as x = 0, {1, {2, to get equa- tions in A, B, and C provides a fast alternative to other methods."}]}